      "heading": "Costs on site",
      "points": [
        {
          "text": "During a retreat, spending appears that was not in the plan: phone and data, an extra transfer, replacing broken equipment, a gift for a guest.",
          "origin": "extract"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "heading": "Plan versus actual",
      "points": [
        {
          "text": "A few days after the retreat, open the calculator with your original numbers.",
